variable C15 equal 0.5*(${C1neg}+${C1pos})
variable C15 equal 0.5*(1037.46694661844+${C1pos})
variable C15 equal 0.5*(1037.46694661844+-1037.45484738046)
variable C2${dir} equal 0.5*(${C2neg}+${C2pos})
